==Trivia==
[[File:ZapdosexGeneticApex276 artwork.png|thumb|Standalone illustration]]
The special illustration rare card features {{p|Zapdos}} flying above [[Kanto]]'s [[Kanto Power Plant|Power Plant]], where it can be found in {{game|Red and Blue|s|Pokémon Red, Blue}}, {{v2|Yellow}}, {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s|FireRed, LeafGreen}}, {{LGPE|Let's Go, Pikachu!, and Let's Go, Eevee!}}; in {{game|HeartGold and SoulSilver|s}}, it is found on {{rt|10|Kanto}}, immediately outside the plant. {{p|Ekans}} and {{p|Spearow}}—both of which can be found on Route 10 in several of the games—also appear in the illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Zapdos}}.
*{{m|Peck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Zapdos}} can learn.
*'''Thundering Hurricane''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Zapdos|41}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.

